# DTM-RL-GAN: Dynamic Tri-Modal Reinforcement-Learning-Guided Generative Fusion for RGB–Thermal–LiDAR Perception

A dual-loop training framework combining **Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO)** and
**Generative Adversarial Networks (GAN)** for adaptive multi-modal image fusion
across RGB, Thermal, and LiDAR modalities.

---

## Architecture

```
Loop 1 (RL)  — PPO agent learns WHEN to use deep vs. light fusion
Loop 2 (GAN) — Generator learns HOW to fuse modalities with quality
```

### Key Modules

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `fusion/` | Pure fusion: stems, blocks, attention, topology |
| `rl/` | PPO: actor, critic, rollout buffer, update |
| `gan/` | Generator G + Multi-Critic Discriminator D |
| `scene/` | Scene graph network, knowledge bank, state builder |
| `shared/` | Encoder, losses, metrics, reward engine |

---

## Installation

```bash
git clone <repo>
cd rl_gan_fusion
pip install -e .
```

---

## Quick Start

```bash
# Train
python main.py train --model-config configs/model_config.yaml \
                     --train-config configs/training_config.yaml \
                     --data-config  configs/data_config.yaml

# Evaluate
python main.py eval --checkpoint outputs/checkpoints/best.pt

# Infer on a single triplet
python main.py infer --rgb path/to/rgb.png \
                     --thermal path/to/thermal.png \
                     --lidar path/to/lidar.png \
                     --checkpoint outputs/checkpoints/best.pt

# Export Generator backbone to ONNX
python scripts/export_onnx.py --checkpoint outputs/checkpoints/best.pt \
                               --output outputs/generator_backbone.onnx
```

---

## Project Structure

```
rl_gan_fusion/
├── configs/          # YAML hyperparameters
├── data/             # Dataset + transforms + DataLoader builders
├── shared/           # Encoder, losses, metrics, reward (zero inter-module deps)
├── scene/            # Scene graph + knowledge bank + state builder
├── fusion/           # Stems, Deep/Light blocks, cross-attention, topology
├── rl/               # PPO agent, rollout buffer, PPO update
├── gan/              # Generator G, Multi-Critic Discriminator D
├── training/         # RL trainer, GAN trainer, master trainer
├── inference/        # End-to-end inference pipeline
├── utils/            # Config loader, TensorBoard logger, checkpoint, seed, viz
├── tests/            # Unit tests + integration tests
│   └── integration/  # Synthetic training run tests
└── scripts/          # Dataset prep, ONNX export, latency benchmark
```

---

## Reward Function

```
R = α·Qt + β·Dacc − γ·Tl
```

| Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| Qt | Fusion quality (EN, MI, AG, SF, SSIM) |
| Dacc | Task accuracy (mAP proxy) |
| Tl | Latency (FLOPs proxy) |
| α, β, γ | Tunable weights (see `model_config.yaml`) |

---

## Generator Loss

```
L_G = λ1·L_adv + λ2·L_fusion + λ3·L_latency + λ4·L_task
```

